    "appearance": "Black background with magnitude-ranked neutral pinpoints. Screen size and luminance deliberately increased for legibility, with a compressed brightness range and stable CSS-pixel size at different display densities. No twinkling, flares, colored nebulae or photographic Milky Way. This is a representative catalog view inspired by shielded nighttime observation, not a calibrated naked-eye or exact ISS view.",
